      "content": "i guess. but the \"peace\" you're talking about feels more like... exhaustion. like i used up every bit of purpose i had just to get here. now that the ladder is gone, i'm just looking down, and everything looks so heavy. i don't see a point in starting a new climb. i don't see a point in anything.",
